                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="80">
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="testimonial-stars">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        “PQJ practice was the best part. It made revision easier and I could measure my improvement.”
                    </p>
                    <div class="testimonial-user">
                        <div class="testimonial-avatar">A</div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Anjali M.</strong>
                            <span>UI / UX Student</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="160">
                <div class="testimonial-card">
                    <div class="testimonial-stars">
                        <i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i><i class="bi bi-star-fill"></i>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        “Dashboard, progress, and premium lesson flow all feel polished. It does not look like a basic course site.”
                    </p>
                    <div class="testimonial-user">
                        <div class="testimonial-avatar">V</div>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Vikas K.</strong>
                            <span>Web Development Learner</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-space pricing-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head text-center" data-aos="fade-up">
            <span class="section-kicker">Simple pricing</span>
            <h2>Choose a plan that matches your pace</h2>
            <p>
                Start with demo classes for free and upgrade when you are ready for full content access.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4 justify-content-center mt-2">
            @{
                int planindex = 0;
            }
            @foreach (var plan in Model.Plans)
            {
                <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="@planindex">
                    <div class="pricing-card">
                        <span class="plan-label">@(plan.PlanName?.Split(' ', StringSplitOptions.RemoveEmptyEntries).FirstOrDefault())</span>
                        <h3>@plan.PlanName</h3>
                        <div class="price">₹@plan.Price</div>
                        @{
                            var features = plan.Description?.Split(',');
                        }
                        <ul class="plan-list">
                            @if (features != null)
                            {
                                foreach (var item in features)
                                {
                                    <li>
                                        <i class="bi bi-check2"></i> @item.Trim()
                                    </li>
                                }
                            }
                        </ul>
                        <a asp-controller="WebHome" asp-action="Plans" class="btn btn-plan">@plan.PlanName</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                planindex += 80;
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-space final-cta-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="final-cta-card" data-aos="zoom-in">
            <div class="final-cta-content">
                <span class="section-kicker">Ready to begin?</span>
                <h2>Start with a demo today and unlock premium learning when you’re ready</h2>
                <p>
                    Experience the platform first, then move into complete lessons, structured dashboards,
                    and high-retention PQJ practice.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="final-cta-actions">
                <a asp-controller="WebHome" asp-action="Demos" class="btn btn-footer-secondary">Watch Demo</a>
                <a asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Register" class="btn btn-footer-primary">Create Account</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>